id:                     E3694
trigger_tool: clang|gcc|cmake|test
phase: compilation|testing
error_signature: no matching function for call to '[ds]tptri_'|requires 7 arguments, but 5 were provided|LP64_REQUIRED|BLAS_LAPACK_WIDTH_MISMATCH
severity:               2
category:               compat, portability, headers
match_keywords: LAPACK_FORTRAN_STRLEN_END, LAPACK_dtptri, LAPACK_stptri, lapack_int, blasint, CLAPACK, hidden character length, LP64, ILP64
title: 使用供应方LAPACK宏保留Fortran字符参数和整数ABI契约
root_cause: C/C++消费方硬编码下划线符号和旧CLAPACK原型，与所链接供应方头文件规定的隐藏CHARACTER长度或整数宽度不一致。更换声明使编译通过本身不证明二进制ABI一致。
affected_scope: 通过供应方lapack.h或lapacke.h调用Fortran LAPACK的C/C++数值库；仅在供应方提供LAPACK_*宏且头文件与二进制匹配时适用。LP64要求只针对已确定使用32位整数的消费方。
verification_cmd: bash archives/k/kaldi-vosk/g20231219/knowledge-reproducer/run.sh OPENBLAS_PACKAGE_PREFIX
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: vendor-lapack-macros-and-integer-contract
rec_description: 保留实际依赖包的lapacke.h/lapack.h，将name_调用替换为LAPACK_name，采用lapack_int并校验blasint及消费方索引宽度。先以负向编译证明差异，再用独立数值残差、错误路径和上游全量测试验证。
rec_command: bash archives/k/kaldi-vosk/g20231219/knowledge-reproducer/run.sh OPENBLAS_PACKAGE_PREFIX
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: verified-vendor-specific-wrapper
fallback_description: 供应方未提供宏接口时，依据其实际编译器ABI建立包装并验证；迁移到LAPACKE须另外核对布局、工作区和返回值。
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: undef.*LAPACK_FORTRAN_STRLEN_END
forbid_1_reason: 隐藏供应方声明会丢失真实调用契约检查。
forbid_1_consequence: 编译成功不足以证明隐藏字符长度和整数参数正确。
forbid_2_pattern: typedef.*int.*KaldiBlasInt
forbid_2_reason: 未检查lapack_int与blasint即假定整数宽度，可能错配LP64与ILP64。
forbid_2_consequence: 索引、pivot及INFO指针访问宽度可能不一致。
doc_file: drafts/E429-draft-8A28.md
last_updated: 2026-10-04
source_event: kaldi-vosk g20231219 OHOS armv8 kv035独立探针；补丁0025/0026及共享静态125上游与53消费者。
authors: sawakage <sawakage@outlook.com>
